  "caption": "Cantonese big-room EDM pop with a festival build and drop. A snare roll and white-noise riser under a filtered pad in each build, then a hard clean drop: a bright supersaw lead stating the riff, a distorted growling bass under it, a hard four-on-the-floor kick with heavy sidechain pumping the whole mix, a crash on every drop. Big, loud and wide, kick and supersaw forward on the drop, the voice forward in the builds. Strong belted female pop lead in the verses and builds, the whole group shouting one hook word on each drop. 128 BPM, G minor. Five office friends screaming a long shot home at the races, loud and triumphant. No trap verse, no glitch effects, no retro 80s synths, no autotune, no ballad breakdown.",
  "lyrics": "[Verse]\n禮拜三 放工 跑馬地 草地仲濕\n五個同事 一人一杯啤酒 企喺欄杆前面\n每人十蚊 唔睇排位 揀個最傻嘅名「準時放工」\n\n[Pre-Chorus]\n閘一開 佢就跑咗包尾\n阿Ben轉身 去買第二杯\n\n[Chorus]\n衝呀！ 衝呀！ 準時放工！\n佢跑包尾 我哋照嗌佢個名\n十蚊一注 輸咗都係少食個下午茶\n衝呀！ 今晚你千祈唔好遲\n\n[Bridge]\n放工！\n\n[Verse]\n轉入最後一個彎 佢突然好似醒咗\n一匹 兩匹 三匹 旁述把聲變到破音\n阿Ben杯啤酒 成杯倒落我對鞋\n\n[Chorus]\n衝呀！ 衝呀！ 準時放工！\n最後一個彎 由包尾 追到第一\n十蚊一注 一賠五十 成個看台望住我哋\n衝呀！ 過埋終點 佢真係準時放工！\n\n[Bridge]\n放工！\n\n[Outro]\n一人五百蚊\n聽朝照樣 九點返工",
